<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: stimulants -->
  <BEWH_ApothecaryStimulantsBuff.label>战斗兴奋剂</BEWH_ApothecaryStimulantsBuff.label>
  <!-- EN: This character is under the effects of emergency stimulants that relieve pain and increase healing speed. Their body is temporarily revitalized, reducing fatigue and speeding recovery, but the effects are short-lived and they may need further care. -->
  <BEWH_ApothecaryStimulantsBuff.description>此人正处于战斗兴奋剂的作用下，这会缓解疼痛并加快愈合速度。除此之外，还能暂时恢复活力，减少疲劳。但兴奋剂效果短暂，战后仍可能需要进一步的医疗护理。</BEWH_ApothecaryStimulantsBuff.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Orders Given! -->
  <BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuff.label>听令！</BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuff.label>
  <!-- EN: This character has given the command with unwavering authority, empowering those around him. -->
  <BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuff.description>此人已下达了作战指令，以其坚定的权威激发周围盟友的战斗意志。</BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuff.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Orders Received! -->
  <BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuffBuff.label>得令！</BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuffBuff.label>
  <!-- EN: This character is under the influence of the Captain's command, which increases their strength, accuracy, and morale. They fight with increased coordination and ferocity, hardening their resolve and increasing their combat effectiveness. -->
  <BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuffBuff.description>此人受到连长指挥的影响，他们士气高涨，作战协同，力量与射击精度均有提升。</BEWH_CaptainsOrderBuffBuff.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Legion Standard -->
  <BEWH_ChapterBannerBuff.label>战旗之下</BEWH_ChapterBannerBuff.label>
  <!-- EN: The sacred banner of my Legion fills me with unwavering resolve, driving me to greater feats in the Emperor's name! -->
  <BEWH_ChapterBannerBuff.description>战团的神圣旗帜赋予此人坚定不移的决心，为了帝皇！</BEWH_ChapterBannerBuff.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Wave of Lethargy -->
  <BEWH_ChiefLibrarianWaveOfLethargyDebuff.label>倦怠脉冲</BEWH_ChiefLibrarianWaveOfLethargyDebuff.label>
  <!-- EN: This character is under the influence of the wave of lethargy. As overwhelming exhaustion sets in, their limbs grow heavy, every movement a struggle. Their senses are dulled, leaving them sluggish and unable to react with the urgency they once had. -->
  <BEWH_ChiefLibrarianWaveOfLethargyDebuff.description>此人正受到倦怠脉冲的影响。随着极度疲惫的袭来，他们的四肢变得沉重，每一个动作都显得费力。他们的感官变得迟钝，行动迟缓，无法像以前那样迅速做出反应。</BEWH_ChiefLibrarianWaveOfLethargyDebuff.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Quickening -->
  <BEWH_LibrarianQuickeningBuff.label>感官强化</BEWH_LibrarianQuickeningBuff.label>
  <!-- EN: The psyker's senses are heightened through precognitive abilities, greatly enhancing their speed and awareness. -->
  <BEWH_LibrarianQuickeningBuff.description>此人的感官通过预知能力得到了增强，速度和意识大大提高。</BEWH_LibrarianQuickeningBuff.description>
  
</LanguageData>